\newlabel{fig:agent_state_before_after}{{3}{7}{Non-destructive governance state propagation for an agent. A change to a required prompt revision preserves the agent revision and its intrinsic lifecycle and quality states, while the derived impact, assurance, and eligibility states are recomputed from the updated dependency context}{figure.caption.7}{}}
